// many_events_ability — the only ability in the corpus, so it takes
// registry slot 1 (build.rs and the runtime both enumerate the corpus
// dir alphabetically, so the slot ids line up). The .sim dispatches it
// as a self-cast once per tick per alive agent; the fixture's whole
// point is that the resulting `EffectDamageApplied` chronicle record
// (engine kind 26) reaches the right consumer in a fixture with 33
// user events.
//
// `target: ally` (hostile_only = false) because the cast targets the
// caster itself. Shape otherwise mirrors hill_raid/Strike.ability.

ability SelfStrike {
    target: ally
    range: 50.0
    cooldown: 0
    hint: damage

    damage 4.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
